"""Source-closed API35 normal packaged launcher reads; no installer authority.

The root guardian and UID1000 worker are separate principals. Construction of
BaselineGuard is an external-Java prerequisite, never packaged acceptance. This
module calls only its authenticated physical/task/stage predicates. The worker
retains the reviewed af9 image/JDK/raw/child machinery and has six finite roles.
No API29, effects, fallback, general argv or transport callback is exposed.
"""
